NOTE ON DATA: this MIT licence covers the code in this repository only. No raw
dataset is redistributed here. The repository does contain DERIVED data:

  * tableau/extracts/*.csv, outputs/*.csv and the data embedded in
    dashboard/decision-dashboard.html / dashboard/dashboard-data.json are derived
    from the Olist datasets (Brazilian E-Commerce and Marketing Funnel by Olist,
    CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). They are shared under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: attribution to Olist,
    non-commercial use only, same licence for adaptations. Changes: aggregated to
    month-level metrics / held-out model scores, and recomputed.
  * historical/criteo_documented_counts.json holds six aggregate counts from the
    Criteo Uplift Modeling dataset (Criteo AI Lab); follow the publisher's terms.
  * sample/ contains only synthetic data generated by this repository's code (MIT).

See docs/source-manifest.md.
